:: place.high-school.gym
@heading "Gym"

@if school.phase == "lunch" or school.phase == "break"
The gym is open, and students are exercising and socialising.
@elseif school.phase == "class"
Everyone looks at you as you enter the gym. The teacher is at the front of the room, and students are exercising.
@else
  There's a lone student here practicing basketball.
@endif

@choice wait-for-class "Wait for class" -> school.class.physical-education
  
  @time-until school.nextClassStartsAt
  @enter-after-time
